                <l xml:id="m-b555b510-692b-426a-91f6-50092a94604a" facs="#m-4df0f46a-8c63-4adc-ab41-1af391e14e04" label="text-like">Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria.</l><l xml:id="m-57cac64c-0614-41ff-9202-d6239d6b106e" facs="#m-c2fee9ca-ae03-4c68-beb8-739fcc71d9c9" label="ambiguous">1083</l><l xml:id="m-e874a0fb-6cda-47ab-a39e-59130f1f2c0c" facs="#m-1e22c64b-da07-467a-b560-187476093849" label="lyrics-like">Dómini,</l><l xml:id="m-255e6ec3-898e-4bc5-bf35-2bb2bd1840a9" facs="#m-4725e6d8-99ee-40d6-ad63-6034c34effd7" label="lyrics-like">réctas fá-ci-te sémi-tas Dé-i nóstri.</l><l xml:id="m-72d3a8d5-0e43-46e6-88de-479d41f0f259" facs="#m-2025f107-9002-47eb-8e9c-5cb95a6904e5" label="ambiguous">Wednesday.</l><l xml:id="m-56bc9135-ad2c-4055-81b0-18840354a987" facs="#m-db08346d-8051-4428-bd1f-00a3ec7a63b8" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-3bf8cf04-55ce-4e2e-b1d4-2242dfed2939" facs="#m-4551b75e-69d2-4571-bd2f-4d36f3ea73e1" label="ambiguous">Ant. S.</l><l xml:id="m-7247d8f8-d477-4cd8-84ca-5f6376266fac" facs="#m-82264537-4a18-4f7b-a4e9-b0bab3cf75a1" label="ambiguous">C</l><l xml:id="m-592e93eb-2698-4bfe-b181-b27cd69dbe46" facs="#m-c5665215-1d86-42c3-ab6e-6587e5120c03" label="lyrics-like">Cce mítto “Ange-lum mé- um, qui praepa-rá¬</l><l xml:id="m-533e5fa2-7f38-44fb-842f-ea9cdf08926b" facs="#m-51ceed89-d760-46df-a8be-40c0b1268b17" label="lyrics-like">bit ví-am mé-am ante fá-ci-em tú- am.</l><l xml:id="m-ea628d94-c8fe-4172-be2e-6496794c39bc" facs="#m-08d50e55-91e6-4e68-8bf9-f8435a64ae13" label="text-like">At vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-b7a41848-c861-416e-b75b-97e11d55b308" facs="#m-d5bc235a-500c-46cb-b2e3-ba324763c904" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-e4b0f032-86f6-4a45-a1bb-73b687f777e4" facs="#m-4bdc9e35-9322-4268-a447-ca5da7349dc9" label="lyrics-like">I-on“ reno-vábe-ris, et vidébis jústum tú-um,</l><l xml:id="m-a9a98eb0-0bfb-4b89-9274-b5ed46014319" facs="#m-061b7e89-976c-4c4d-bdf7-8bf057c74596" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-6c4854ec-9179-4d00-aa9c-12c0e58595e1" facs="#m-7a3f01e9-169f-4dc5-a4a8-7fe06d9b87bf" label="lyrics-like">qui ventú-rus est in te.</l><l xml:id="m-77243ccb-6dff-463a-b6fd-164c20c34294" facs="#m-1d662cc2-16fe-4f84-be7e-a5033794aae0" label="ambiguous">Thursday.</l><l xml:id="m-6ebda769-40b6-4765-86f4-7e5020b2eeab" facs="#m-5bda9430-7b91-4cfd-8369-dea7572c6335" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-49a7d752-648d-448a-b3e7-f298ddbeeded" facs="#m-183992ab-909f-453d-a1af-e35cd558f955" label="ambiguous">Ant. 7.</l><l xml:id="m-fa19e129-4515-4cbd-ac03-ac86a9d364f9" facs="#m-c8931cef-c47e-4720-9513-d1dd248a5b9d" label="ambiguous">F</l><l xml:id="m-85cc3dce-5b2d-4fff-9e41-649cbc5b1d4e" facs="#m-f2baafcd-a24b-421d-a2b2-c7d4865a37ce" label="lyrics-like">U es *qui ventúrus es, Dómine, quem exspe¬</l><l xml:id="m-c37e003d-8127-44aa-a9af-3b34b8ec624f" facs="#m-bb8b2acb-e7bc-4e26-b7b9-5a5d778aeb0a" label="lyrics-like">ut sálvum fá-ci¬as póou lam tú¬um.</l><l xml:id="m-72055b50-01fe-4192-9f52-4cd1aff98088" facs="#m-c4b3f54f-bdbc-4e6b-a50c-64db8cd63061" label="lyrics-like">ctámus,</l><l xml:id="m-0c1fc12f-0ef5-4745-89e6-86b050238437" facs="#m-3b6af4e5-1150-4dc8-a7e8-bb13fc0d2bbc" label="text-like">At Vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-a07f58fd-ab44-49ba-99e7-f6628ae01918" facs="#m-4e4d88f2-32d8-41f4-9f71-50be3b8e1da8" label="ambiguous">Ant. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-b5c95779-6461-4525-8196-5a6ccbab1ce9" facs="#m-1e08bc32-b99e-4d10-b34c-0517d6efc101" label="ambiguous">0</l><l xml:id="m-075c0813-7fbc-4a11-a5f6-d2b33bf6e5d5" facs="#m-06d58267-9588-4f26-826b-e88d27dace43" label="lyrics-like">UI post me vénit, " ante me fáctus est: cújus</l><l xml:id="m-ffa50542-78eb-4092-b463-7199ec86b7a2" facs="#m-736a1d2d-0497-4b38-8a0a-67da5b8ad3d1" label="lyrics-like">non sum dígnus calce-aménta sólvere.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
